WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Emily>Welcome to the Ebb launch livestream.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
<v Paul>The Ebb goes on sale on the twenty first of April.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
<v Emily>Launch customers get a free rain cover for the cargo box.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:21.000
<v Paul>Test rides start at the Calder market stall on launch weekend.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.000
<v Emily>Book a test ride on our website.

